# Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind: "{T}: Add {R}. If that mana is spent on a Dragon creature spell, it gains haste until end of turn"
# (CR 603.7a, 106.3). Bot1 casts the Orb with a Black Lotus, then pays a Firespitter Whelp ({2}{R}) with the Orb's mana and two Mox
# Rubies, which is enough though only one of the three is the Orb's (the ruling: any part of the cost). The Whelp attacks on the
# turn it was cast (20 to 18, its haste) and has no haste on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind
Mox Ruby x2
Firespitter Whelp
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Firespitter Whelp.Cast
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Firespitter Whelp.Keywords = Flying; Haste
[T1 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Firespitter Whelp > Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 18
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Firespitter Whelp.Keywords = Flying

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
